As an early-game wish, you can always wish for an artifact (staff of
misspelling is a good one for Wizards.)

A blessed bag of holding is often a good wish if you're nowhere near
Sokoban, or if you got the amulet.  That would help with being burdened as
well.

I personally would go with one of the following:
- blessed fixed +3 speed boots
- blessed fixed +3 staff of abracadabrius (look up the real spelling :P)
- blessed spellbook of magic missile
- blessed magic marker

These are, of course, very dependant on your capability to do something
useful with them.  The staff will help you avoid death by HP loss, while
the spellbook or magic marker will let you make stuff die very quickly,
and the boots just give you extra turns.  Whichever one you think matches
with what you want to do best...



